                                                "sense_id": "2a4ffdd7-9b8c-3651-aa61-a5e4c13f45aa",
                                                "text": "Witness to this is the appointment by the Minister of Transport of an Under-Secretary who will concentrate on Channel Tunnel affairs—and Mr O. F. Gingell is evidently expected to have a plateful of work for some long time to come."
